&lt;p style="margin-top: 0pt; margin-bottom: 0pt; text-align: justify; font-size: 16pt;"&gt;&lt;font style="font-family: Arial;"&gt;The differences between our actual income tax expense and the amount computed by applying the statutory federal income tax rate of 21% are summarized as follows (in millions):&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/p&gt;
